# A highlighter stroke inside an object's box but on no characters (the empty end of its second line): no object
# takes it, and the stroke stays as drawn (#3, device 2026-11-24: it was undone for the object and lost, the switch to
# the Text objects layer having cleared the redo history). A stroke on the characters still becomes a band.
open
object "testing  testing testing testing testing" 1100 1400
tool pen
mark
highlight 1320 1520 1434
wait 4000
expect-log "no text object under it: the stroke drawn again"
expect-ink 1310 1415 1530 1455 mark
shot nochar-1
mark
highlight 1100 1300 1434
wait 3000
expect-log "band\(s\) on the text layer, with 1 object"
